    "content": "Hire From Us Hire Employees of the FUTURE Recruit the Proficient’s with Qualified Skills from 3RI Technologies \"I encourage you to assess & judge our scholars for different roles in your companies and I promise that they will take up your business to the next level, with their new skills and knowledge.\" - Ritesh Sharma | Dirctor/CEO, 3RI Technologies 3RI Technologies Pvt Ltd, Pune has proved itself in being one of the best platforms for upgrading and sharpening your skills and talents. Each candidate from 3RI is well-expertise in their field and are ready to get on the floor and implement their talent to advance the company and provide them benefits and profits through their skills. Register Now to Hire from Us! Send Overview of 3RI Technologies 3RI Technologies is a committed team of highly endured – latest & upcoming technology professionals, determined and sharpened on fulfilling the best quality online training programs in Pune to all the IT and non-IT professionals (willing the start their career into IT field). Our training programs for all the technologies are designed as per the latest syllabus and technology upgrades. Also, it is verified and changed whenever new features are introduced into a program. Each online training is conducted with well-proficient and experienced instructors which help you understand every concept with real-time scenarios and project implementation. We promise to deliver you the whole program knowledge practically as well as theoretically. 3RI Technologies Strengths Engaged | Experienced | Exclusive Job Ready Experts Experienced with real-time Scenarios, Projects & Concepts Devoted towards their job profile Why hire from 3RI Technologies? Expert in their field trained with practical and theoretical knowledge Well trained with industry aspects, terms Experienced with real-time scenarios, projects and more Aware about the deadlines, pressure handling and more When you hire from 3RI, you are guaranteed with: Expert in their field trained with practical and theoretical knowledge Well trained with industry aspects, terms Experienced with real-time scenarios, projects and more Aware about the deadlines, pressure handling and more Why Us? Offline & Online Hiring We help you connect with the best employee, trained by our expertise which will indeed act in upgrading your company to the next level. No Hiring Fees This is true! We do not take any addition fees as such for recruitment realted services. Hiring Methods Shortlisting with tests and different round followed by interviews according to your convenience.",
